troduce bugs when relying on psalm's output directly in this obscure edge case)\r\n\r\n```\r\nphp > echo \"\\a\\b\";\r\n\\a\\b\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdditionally, \"\\x7f\" is the ASCII backspace character and should probably also be escaped.\r\n\r\nFollowup to https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/5733\r\n\r\nNoticed while working on representing php strings/arrays for a different application. https://github.com/TysonAndre/var_representation_polyfill/blob/0.1.1/src/VarRepresentation/Encoder.php#L240-L255 may be more appropriate\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/6314/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/6314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]